  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. Amazon CloudWatch Events helps you to respond to state changes in your AWS resources. When your resources change state they automatically send events into an event stream. You can create rules that match selected events in the stream and route them to targets to take action. You can also use rules to take action on a pre-determined schedule.",
